      "path": "tex/06-probabilistic-graphical-models/01-representation/04-representations.tex",
      "line": 115,
      "text": "\\begin{proof}[定理~\\ref{thm:pgm-representations-ancestral-moralization}的证明]",
      "archive": false,
      "sha256": "38408040360897a2c927787e83f6a1ac10f4cba9a27da86da7d313f58d69f450"
    },
    {
      "path": "tex/06-probabilistic-graphical-models/01-representation/04-representations.tex",
      "line": 183,
      "text": "在$\\operatorname{mor}(\\mathcal{G}[R])\\setminus S$中，将与$A$相交的分量合为$C$，其他节点合为$D=R\\setminus(C\\cup S)$。祖先道德化判据，即定理~\\ref{thm:pgm-representations-ancestral-moralization}，保证$B\\subseteq D$。将涉及$C$的因子相乘记为$g(\\bm{x}_C,\\bm{x}_S)$，涉及$D$的因子相乘记为$h(\\bm{x}_D,\\bm{x}_S)$，其余只涉及$S$的因子相乘记为$k(\\bm{x}_S)$，得到",
      "archive": false,
      "sha256": "38408040360897a2c927787e83f6a1ac10f4cba9a27da86da7d313f58d69f450"
    },
    {
      "path": "tex/06-probabilistic-graphical-models/01-representation/04-representations.tex",
