      "line": 371,
      "text": "  \\label{thm:pgm-representations-perfect-undirected}",
      "archive": false,
      "sha256": "38408040360897a2c927787e83f6a1ac10f4cba9a27da86da7d313f58d69f450"
    },
    {
      "path": "tex/06-probabilistic-graphical-models/01-representation/04-representations.tex",
      "line": 516,
      "text": "以$N_k^+$为$v_k$的父集，便获得定理~\\ref{thm:pgm-representations-chordal-perfect}的有向图。父节点在消元时晚于当前节点，所以拓扑序是消元序的逆序。每张新条件表已归一化，而求出它们的过程包含了原分布的边缘化和全局归一化计算；这些工作随表重组一同完成\\scite{pgm-koller2009}",
      "archive": false,
      "sha256": "38408040360897a2c927787e83f6a1ac10f4cba9a27da86da7d313f58d69f450"
    },
    {
      "path": "tex/06-probabilistic-graphical-models/02-inference/02-junction-tree.tex",
